{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Video Compressor 是一款可將單個或多個影片壓縮至指定 MB 上限的工具，適合需要透過電郵附件、工作通訊、學校提交或上傳表格傳送影片的使用者。目前限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>壓縮影片至指定大小</h2>\n<p>可從「照片」或「檔案」選擇影片，亦可透過 iOS 分享選單接收影片，一次批次壓縮最多 10 段。可選 10、25、50、100 MB 或自訂大小，App 會分析每段影片並自動選取合適解像度、幀率與壓縮設定，並在儲存或分享前核對結果是否符合所選大小，亦可選擇 H.264 或 HEVC 格式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-180-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-181-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Video Compressor: Size Limit</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T05:12:07.036809+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}